4659:       /* Posix.2 says special builtins are found before functions.  We
4660: 	 don't set builtin_is_special anywhere other than here, because
4661: 	 this path is followed only when the `command' builtin is *not*
4662: 	 being used, and we don't want to exit the shell if a special
4663: 	 builtin executed with `command builtin' fails.  `command' is not
4664: 	 a special builtin. */
